# Authenticated PDF / binary download (class)

**Invariant:** `timeout(Playwright expect_download) ⇏ unreachable(PDF)` · `stale(last_statement) ⇒ export(since close)` · any authenticated host.

9784 BofA August PDF was parked as “timed out.” That is the class, not the site.

| Want | Do |
|---|---|
| File from a signed-in tab (bank, court, Scribd, invoice) | `dispatch(tool="browse")` + `save_to` on Jupiter `:9222` |
| `save_to` wrote HTML, or the click opens a viewer | `save_to` + click `actions`, or CDP `Browser.setDownloadBehavior` |
| Prove it is a PDF | `xxd -p -l 5` → `255044462d` (`%PDF-`) |
| Last statement PDF is stale | Export activity / CSV / SimpleFIN since close — ¬ wait for the next cycle |

¬ park “PDF timed out” as a standing gap. ¬ treat Playwright download timeout as done.

